msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:866
msgid "**Lock file exclusively**"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:868
msgid "When enabled, the locked file will be locked exclusively. When disabled, the other user who is trying to open the locked file will be notified about the lock status, but will still be able to open the file."
msgstr ""

