msgid "**Automatically open file in read only mode when file is locked and \"Lock file exclusively\" is not checked.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:873
msgid "When this setting is enabled (default), a second attempt to open a locked file will result in the file opening in read-only mode. If \"Lock file exclusively\" is checked, then second user will not be able to open a locked file."
