msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1263
msgid "For Amazon S3 type of cloud storage/object storage, it is recommended NOT to force file upload and download going through worker nodes, because Amazon S3 is good for offload the upload/download between the access clients and the backend Amazon S3 storage. However, for OpenStack Swift storage, depending on how it is set up, you may want to turn this on to force File Upload/Download going through worker node for security reasons."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1265
msgid "This setting may be checked by default. However, based on your configuration, it may not need to be checked."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1267
