msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1269
msgid "There may be some situations  that this setting must be checked. For example, you may be using native object storage such as Amazon S3 for storage. However, your company policy may disable direct access to Amazon S3. So in this case, you will have to route traffic through the worker node."
msgstr ""

