#: ../chapter03.rst:1402
msgid "**Users must log in to access the content in 'Files shared with me' folder**"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1404
msgid "When sharing files and folders with users, you can force the sharing to create guest accounts for users that are not already in the system. It is more secure when asking the receiver of the share to sign in to receive shared items. This disables anonymous sharing."
msgstr ""

