msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1453
msgid "By default the file name or folder name is used for the share name. However, if user has many same name folders or files. Sharing them out sometimes many not know which is which. This setting allows user to change share name. For example, when sharing out a \"Documents\" folder, it can be named \"Documents in top level folder\"."
