msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1723
msgid "Client Startup Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1724
msgid "After the Windows client is completely started and finished loading, a command line script can be run. You can be upload that script here. For example, a script to map an additional drive letter to a specific folder inside the cloud drive."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1728
msgid "Client Shutdown Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1729
msgid "Right before the Windows client is completely shutdown and finished running, a command line script can be run. You can upload that script here. For example, a script to clean up any reference to folders and files inside the cloud drive."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1733
msgid "Mac Client Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1734
msgid "**Do not show Mac Client sync status pop up dialog**"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1736
msgid "This is usually good for usability but people may find it annoying if the file status is popping up a progress dialog at the lower right corner."
msgstr ""

