#: ../chapter03.rst:1767
msgid "**Web Browser - Disable Flash Uploader**"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter03.rst:1769
msgid "Some organization standardized on web browser, for example, all web browser are HTML5 compliant. In this case, Flash Uploader is not necessary and could be confusing to support when different users have different Flash version installed. Different kind of web browser may also have different levels of Flash support, causing different behavior."
